il suo desiderio si trasforma in realtà.","tagline":"Un film che è un atto d'amore di una grande regista di oggi per un grande regista di ieri"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Jacquot","overview":"Jacquot Demy, the son of a garage owner and a hairdresser, is fascinated by cinema and decides to pursue his dream of becoming a filmmaker by any means necessary."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Il était une fois un garçon, élevé dans un garage où tout le monde aimait chanter. C'était en 1939, il avait 8 ans, il aimait les marionnettes et les opérettes. Puis il a voulu faire du cinéma mais son père lui a fait étudier la mécanique. C'est de Jacques Demy qu'il s'agit et de ses souvenirs. C'est une enfance heureuse qui nous est contée, malgré les évènements de la guerre et de l'après-guerre."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vTewRGlWNI3evxByDwEygXr9Wsh.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mmLJoiJOBqlxtZos6DRX9pl5Orm.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":41789,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vTewRGlWNI3evxByDwEygXr9Wsh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vTewRGlWNI3evxByDwEygXr9Wsh.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vTewRGlWNI3evxByDwEygXr9Wsh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vTewRGlWNI3evxByDwEygXr9Wsh.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aFobRFRdkDPGv3GW5jWlhEW4PpC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aFobRFRdkDPGv3GW5jWlhEW4PpC.jpg","language":"it","width":767,"height":1151},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/LLzdlDaLoxhd1jJ0gljklk6gJ1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/